    "contents": [
      "A Text with content: Gato is a new reinforcement learning agent \r\ncapable of doing a wide range of tasks such \r\nas robotic manipulation, game playing, image \r\ncaptioning, and natural language generation. \r\nThe release of such models suggests that AI \r\nsystems are becoming better at generalization.",
      "A Text with content: DALL-E 2, a text-to-image AI system that can create \r\nrealistic art and images from textual descriptions, is \r\nreleased to the public, igniting a generative AI craze.",
      "A PageFooter with content: 75",
      "A SectionHeader with content: OpenAI Releases DALL-E 2",
      "A SectionHeader with content: DeepMind Launches Gato",
      "A figure with content unknown",
      "A SectionHeader with content: Google Releases PaLM",
      "A Text with content: Google\u2019s AI team trains one of the world\u2019s \r\nlargest language models, PaLM. Made up \r\nof 540 billion parameters, PaLM reinforces \r\nthe belief that researchers can improve \r\nperformance on large language models by \r\nsimply training them on more data.",
      "A Text with content: Make-A-Scene is a text-to-image AI model that \r\nenables users to generate images through text. \r\nMake-A-Scene is one of many text-to-image \r\nmodels released in 2022.",
      "A figure with content unknown",
      "A SectionHeader with content: Meta AI Releases Make-A-Scene ",
      "A figure with content unknown",
      "A Caption with content: Figure 2.1.7",
      "A PageFooter with content: Table of Contents Chapter 2 Preview "
    ]
