    "contents": [
      "A Text with content: ImageNet is one of the most widely used \r\nbenchmarks for image classifcation. This dataset \r\nincludes over 14 million images across 20,000 \r\ndiferent object categories such as \u201cstrawberry\u201d or \r\n\u201cballoon.\u201d Performance on ImageNet is measured \r\nthrough various accuracy metrics. Top-1 accuracy \r\nmeasures the degree to which the top prediction \r\ngenerated by an image classifcation model for a \r\ngiven image actually matches the image\u2019s label.",
      "A Text with content: As of 2022, the best image classifcation system on \r\nImageNet has a top-1 accuracy rate of 91.0% (Figure \r\n2.2.2). Although the current image classifcation \r\ncapabilities of state-of-the-art systems is 27.7 \r\npercentage points better than a decade ago, last \r\nyear saw a very marginal 0.1 percentage point \r\nimprovement in classifcation accuracy.",
      "A Text with content: Image classifcation is the ability of machines to \r\ncategorize objects in images (Figure 2.2.1).",
      "A Text with content: Computer vision is the subfeld of AI that teaches machines to understand images and videos. Computer vision technologies have a \r\nvariety of important real-world applications, such as autonomous driving, crowd surveillance, sports analytics, and video-game creation.\r\nThis section tracks progress in computer vision across several diferent task domains which include: (1) image classifcation, (2) \r\nface detection and recognition, (3) deepfake detection, (4) human pose estimation, (5) semantic segmentation, (6) medical image \r\nsegmentation, (7) object detection, (8) image generation, and (9) visual reasoning.",
      "A SectionHeader with content: ImageNet",
      "A PageFooter with content: 81",
      "A figure with content unknown",
      "A figure with content unknown",
      "A SectionHeader with content: 2.2 Computer Vision\u2014Image",
      "A PageHeader with content: 2.2 Computer Vision\u2014Image\r\nChapter 2: Technical Performance",
      "A SectionHeader with content: Image Classifcation",
      "A PageFooter with content: Table of Contents Chapter 2 Preview "
    ]
  },
